'''Geth'kar''' is a Dragonmaw fortress located in the [[Grim Reaches]], to the southwest of [[Zarm'geth Stronghold]]. It serves as the [[Dragonmaw clan]]'s main supply depot in the region.<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|36|Assault on Geth'kar}}</ref>

